Thus after we finish preparing origin and destination and re-linking origin, we will have candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha true.

Thus we can authorize transport leg loading after assembling leg.

Now we also need vehicle_allocated destination_availability_alpha (goal). We'll allocate vehicle_unit_beta to destination via allocate_vehicle_unit earlier.

We also need vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma (goal). After we execute schedule dispatch on shift_candidate_alpha, we will free vehicle_unit_gamma.

